  "_comment": [
    "Fake Akahu payloads used by the fixture gateway (AKAHU_MODE=fixture).",
    "Shapes match the real /accounts and /accounts/{id}/transactions responses",
    "so the fixture gateway and the live gateway share the same normalise code.",
    "",
    "Deliberately included, because each one has broken a real importer before:",
    "  - amounts that round badly as floats (-5.5, 12.35, -0.07, -1234.56)",
