    "  - a same-day transfer pair across the two accounts (Phase 2 fodder)",
    "  - transactions either side of 31 March, the NZ financial year boundary",
    "  - ~2 years of history, matching what the regulated banks actually hold",
    "",
    "No real account numbers or ids. Nothing here is sensitive."
